      "text": "God loveth his children, 1 Ne. 11:17. tree of life represents love of God, 1 Ne. 11:22, 25. waters are representation of love of God, 1 Ne. 11:25. the Lord loveth those who will have him to be their God, 1 Ne. 17:40. Lehi1 is encircled eternally in arms of God’s love, 2 Ne. 1:15. God hath filled me with his love, 2 Ne. 4:21. the Lord loveth world, layeth down life, 2 Ne. 26:24. feast upon God’s love, Jacob 3:2. if ye retain in remembrance greatness of God, ye shall be filled with his love, Mosiah 4:11–12. God has made gospel known to Lamanites because he loves them, Alma 24:14. the Lord has chastened Nephites because he loves them, Hel. 15:3. the Lord’s love is charity, Ether 12:34. charity is pure love of Christ, Moro. 7:47.",
